<title>FINLAND: YIT SAYS BUYS PLUMBING FIRM IN VAASA.</title>
<headline>YIT SAYS BUYS PLUMBING FIRM IN VAASA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction group YIT-Yhtyma said on Monday its Huber Servitec unit had acquired Oy P H Pundars Ab, which it said was a leader in heating and plumbing in the Vaasa region, for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the company's net sales last year were about 10 million markka and that it bought it from its managing director Peter Jakobsson and office director Lars Wallin, who would both continue in their current posts.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
